    {
      "source": "A variant of <a href=\"#doCommit(java.util.function.Supplier)\"><code>doCommit(Supplier)</code></a> for a response without a body.",
      "translation": "一个用于无正文响应的 `<a href=\"#doCommit(java.util.function.Supplier)\"><code>doCommit(Supplier)</code></a>` 变体。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Apply <a href=\"#beforeCommit(java.util.function.Supplier)\"><code>beforeCommit</code></a> actions, apply the\nresponse status and headers/cookies, and write the response body.",
      "translation": "应用 `<a href=\"#beforeCommit(java.util.function.Supplier)\"><code>beforeCommit</code></a>` 操作，应用响应状态和头/cookie，并写入响应体。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "a <code>Mono</code> that indicates completion or error",
      "translation": "一个指示完成或错误的<code>Mono</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that some subclasses use an <a href=\"../../HttpHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>HttpHeaders</code></a> instance that\nwraps an adapter to the native response headers such that changes are\npropagated to the underlying response on the go. That means this callback\nmight not be used other than for specialized updates such as setting\nthe contentType or characterEncoding fields in a Servlet response.",
      "translation": "请注意，某些子类使用一个<a href=\"../../HttpHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>HttpHeaders</code></a>实例来包装对原生响应头的适配器，以便将更改实时传播到底层响应。这意味着此回调可能仅用于专门的更新，例如在 Servlet 响应中设置 contentType 或 characterEncoding 字段。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Use the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> of <code>Publishers</code> to write the body\nof the HttpOutputMessage to the underlying HTTP layer, flushing after\neach <code>Publisher&lt;DataBuffer&gt;</code>.",
      "translation": "使用 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a>` 的 `<code>Publishers</code>` 来将 `HttpOutputMessage` 的主体写入底层 HTTP 层，并在每个 `<code>Publisher&lt;DataBuffer&gt;</code>` 之后刷新。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
