    {
      "source": "Base class for <a href=\"ServerHttpResponse.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>ServerHttpResponse</code></a> implementations.",
      "translation": "`ServerHttpResponse` 实现的基类。<a href=\"ServerHttpResponse.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>ServerHttpResponse</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add cookies from <a href=\"#getHeaders()\"><code>getHeaders()</code></a> to the underlying response.",
      "translation": "从<a href=\"#getHeaders()\"><code>getHeaders()</code></a>添加 Cookie 到底层响应中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a href=\"../../../core/io/buffer/DataBufferFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBufferFactory</code></a> that can be used to create the body.",
      "translation": "返回一个可用于创建主体的<a href=\"../../../core/io/buffer/DataBufferFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBufferFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Use the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> to write the body of the message to the\nunderlying HTTP layer.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> 将消息体写入底层 HTTP 层。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add cookies from <a href=\"#getHeaders()\"><code>getHeaders()</code></a> to the underlying response.\nThis method is called once only.",
      "translation": "从 `<a href=\"#getHeaders()\"><code>getHeaders()</code></a>` 添加 Cookie 到底层响应中。此方法仅调用一次。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add the given <code>ResponseCookie</code>.",
      "translation": "添加给定的<code>ResponseCookie</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Write to the underlying the response, and flush after each <code>Publisher&lt;DataBuffer&gt;</code>.",
      "translation": "写入底层响应，并在每个 `<code>Publisher&lt;DataBuffer&gt;</code>` 之后刷新。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the status code that has been set, or otherwise fall back on the\nstatus of the response from the underlying server. The return value may\nbe <code>null</code> if there is no default value from the\nunderlying server.",
      "translation": "返回已设置的响应状态码，否则回退到底层服务器的响应状态。如果底层服务器没有默认值，返回值可能为 `<code>null</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a mutable map with the cookies to send to the server.",
      "translation": "返回一个可变映射，其中包含要发送到服务器的 Cookie。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the headers of this message.",
      "translation": "返回此消息的标题。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the HttpOutputMessage is committed.",
      "translation": "HttpOutputMessage 是否已提交。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the HTTP status code to the given value as an integer.",
      "translation": "将 HTTP 状态码设置为给定的整数值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the HTTP status code of the response.",
      "translation": "设置响应的 HTTP 状态码。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Allow subclasses to associate a hint with the data buffer if it is a\npooled buffer and supports leak tracking.",
      "translation": "允许子类在数据缓冲区为支持泄漏跟踪的池化缓冲区时，关联一个提示。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Write to the underlying the response.",
      "translation": "写入底层响应。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Write the status code to the underlying response.\nThis method is called once only.",
      "translation": "将状态码写入底层响应。此方法仅调用一次。",
      "count": 2
